{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026azWMGylzlR1792747200.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>蘭桂坊及附近街道的首階段美化工程完成，訪客即日起，可欣賞塗畫作品，以及晚上的光影藝術表演。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LKF-1700.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bevYOXK2uQ1792747389.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>表演逢周五至日及公眾假期，晚上7時至凌晨2時，在德己立街石牆及附近路面上演，每節約3分鐘，每10分鐘播放一次，首個主題為萬聖節。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LKF-1700_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026s0iiAfjcrP1792747428.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>而德己立街毗鄰的擋土牆將有一幅長達43米，以「今昔蛻變」為主題，由街頭藝術創作團隊創作，延伸至榮華里的大型塗畫。蘭桂坊核心範圍的部分行車路面亦已重鋪。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LKF-1700_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026n2nATr11Ml1792747448.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>發展局指，蘭桂坊垃圾收集站亦快將完成外觀美化。明年中開始，將陸續完成蘭桂坊核心範圍內，其餘行車路的重鋪工程。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:47.396002+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:08.839102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:18.013580+00:00","content_hash":"d0b0a693d20c70995b8e98468f56e31d0811ceeb7a607af5ae72fa3f25fb7d76","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:47.396002+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}